An ancient clan of [[Seekers]] sealed up Araknos's Ring in this temple. {{source|The Mission}}

In the late 1950s, the temple was discovered by [[Eathon Lambert]], [[Metz]] and [[Simon Judeau]] while on a mission for the [[Huntik Foundation]]. They found a warning that the Titan was protected with a mortal curse, but Judeau ignored it and tried to take the ring. He was thus afflicted by the curse. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}}

